{"contract_version": "2", "snapshot": "7e1592a61452d437ae46fab589317d2ac7b10c5a02c6c966097fa679a963a57c", "query": {"kind": "subject", "namespace": "bangumi.subject", "value": "1"}, "status": "found", "entry_key": {"kind": "subject", "namespace": "bangumi.subject", "value": "1"}, "tag_key": null, "canonical": {"entry_key": {"kind": "subject", "namespace": "bangumi.subject", "value": "1"}, "locator": null, "descriptions": [{"title": "第一次的親密接觸", "original": "　　風靡華人世界的網戀小說經典，暢銷紀錄超過百萬冊！\r\n　　有最初的《第一次的親密接觸》，才有今日網路文學。\r\n　　蔡智恆的最新作品《暖暖》，提升你的戀愛幸福溫度。\r\n　　紀念版收錄蔡智恆醞釀十年，最溫柔的純愛萬語宣言。\r\n　　PH值小於7的微酸心情，讓十年後的痞子蔡告訴你。\r\n　　一場最美麗的網路解逅，當痞子蔡遇見輕舞飛揚……\r\n　　蔡智恆最真實的情感原點\r\n　　痞子蔡與輕舞飛揚一起記錄的甜蜜日子\r\n　　一則發生在成大校園的純愛故事，網路上一再被轉載的熱門小說。", "response_truncated": 0, "search_text_truncated": 0, "source_id": "bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a", "evidence_id": "bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1", "status": "source_backed"}], "matched_documents": [{"title": "第一次的親密接觸", "original": "　　風靡華人世界的網戀小說經典，暢銷紀錄超過百萬冊！\r\n　　有最初的《第一次的親密接觸》，才有今日網路文學。\r\n　　蔡智恆的最新作品《暖暖》，提升你的戀愛幸福溫度。\r\n　　紀念版收錄蔡智恆醞釀十年，最溫柔的純愛萬語宣言。\r\n　　PH值小於7的微酸心情，讓十年後的痞子蔡告訴你。\r\n　　一場最美麗的網路解逅，當痞子蔡遇見輕舞飛揚……\r\n　　蔡智恆最真實的情感原點\r\n　　痞子蔡與輕舞飛揚一起記錄的甜蜜日子\r\n　　一則發生在成大校園的純愛故事，網路上一再被轉載的熱門小說。", "response_truncated": 0, "search_text_truncated": 0, "source_id": "bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a", "evidence_id": "bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1", "status": "source_backed"}], "aliases": [], "identity_evidence": [{"source_id": "bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a", "evidence_id": "bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1", "status": "source_backed", "type": "subject", "locator": null, "payload": "{\"key\": {\"kind\": \"subject\", \"namespace\": \"bangumi.subject\", \"value\": \"1\"}, \"status\": \"source_backed\", \"raw\": {\"id\": 1, \"type\": 1, \"infobox\": \"{{Infobox animanga/Novel\\r\\n|中